Maintainer: APPLICATION_MAINTAINER
Installed-Size: APPLICATION_INSTALLED_SIZE
Provides: APPLICATION_PACKAGE
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libasound2t64 | libasound2, libx11-6, libxext6, libxi6, libxrender1, libxtst6, libfreetype6, libfontconfig1, zlib1g
Recommends: libpulse0 | pipewire-pulse, libgl1, libgtk-3-0
Description: Podcast player organised around groups
 Neutrodyne plays podcasts and YouTube channels in user-defined groups, each
 with its own newest-first episode feed, on Windows, macOS and Linux. It works
 fully offline and syncs through an optional self-hosted server.
X-Comment: Neutrodyne's DEB control file (11 Linux DEB, RPM and tar.gz).
 dpkg-deb rejects # comments, so notes ride as X- fields; jpackage's
 APPLICATION_* tokens are substituted at package time. The portable Depends
 names (>= bullseye, or bookworm's libasound2t64 alternative) cover the sonames
 the JARs' natives and the JVM need; the maintainer scripts install the frozen
 desktop entry.
